    "contents": [
      "A Text with content: This chapter captures trends in AI R&D. It begins by examining AI publications, \r\nincluding journal articles, conference papers, and repositories. Next it considers data \r\non signifcant machine learning systems, including large language and multimodal \r\nmodels. Finally, the chapter concludes by looking at AI conference attendance and \r\nopen-source AI research. Although the United States and China continue to dominate \r\nAI R&D, research eforts are becoming increasingly geographically dispersed.",
      "A PageFooter with content: 22",
      "A figure with content unknown",
      "A SectionHeader with content: Overview",
      "A PageHeader with content: Chapter 1: Research and Development"
    ]
