    "contents": [
      "A Text with content: In order to paint a picture of AI\u2019s evolving \r\ngeopolitical landscape, the AI Index research \r\nteam identifed the nationality of the authors who \r\ncontributed to the development of each signifcant \r\nmachine learning system in the Epoch dataset.7",
      "A Text with content: Figure 1.2.3 showcases the total number of \r\nsignifcant machine learning systems attributed to \r\nresearchers from particular countries.8 A researcher \r\nis considered to have belonged to the country in \r\nwhich their institution, for example a university ",
      "A Text with content: or AI-research frm, was headquartered. In 2022, \r\nthe United States produced the greatest number \r\nof signifcant machine learning systems with 16, \r\nfollowed by the United Kingdom (8) and China (3). \r\nMoreover, since 2002 the United States has outpaced \r\nthe United Kingdom and the European Union, as well \r\nas China, in terms of the total number of signifcant \r\nmachine learning systems produced (Figure 1.2.4). \r\nFigure 1.2.5 displays the total number of signifcant \r\nmachine learning systems produced by country since \r\n2002 for the entire world.",
      "A SectionHeader with content: Systems",
      "A SectionHeader with content: National Afliation",
